  "details": "When searching for a user by their exact name, they may not be returned as the first result (or even within the first 25 results!). It appears the search removes all symbols before searching for relevant results and displaying them, this results in accounts with common names and various symbols added to be difficult to locate in search. Below are some examples of this:\n\n\"Emma-_-\" is currently the 22nd result\n\n\"¿Max?\" is the 6th result\n\n\"Sam-_-\" is 11th\n\n\"༒ᴀʟᴇx༒\" is 1st, but \"༒-alex-༒\" is 10th.\n\nIt also appears the order can also randomly change so these may be returned at different positions in the future.",
